40
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:40,640
This display is a result of recording reflections from in-vessel components.

41
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:47,560
Accurate location of any reflection can be determined from range and azimuth indicators on the instrument panel.

42
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:56,680
An ultrasonic sweep arm based on this technology has been proposed for use in the Clinch River breeder reactor during each refueling operation.

43
00:03:56,820 --> 00:04:02,680
Such a system would locate out of position core components to prevent damage during refueling.
